<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Omnipoint started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Omnipoint started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns initiated coverage of Omnipoint Corp and set a price target of $36 a share, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Omnipoint gained 1-3/8 to 23-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
